       "text": "I haven't entered this order because the dose looks unsafe.\n\n- **Order as written:** ibuprofen 1600 mg PO four times daily is 6,400 mg/day.\n- **Daily maximum:** The usual maximum for adults is 3,200 mg/day under medical supervision. This order is double that.\n- **Single-dose maximum:** The usual maximum is 800 mg per dose. This order is double that too.\n- **Risks at this dose:** It raises the risk of GI bleeding, kidney injury, and cardiovascular events. Normal kidney and liver function and no allergies don't change that.\n\nWas one of these intended?\n- **800 mg PO four times daily** (3,200 mg/day), which is the maximum dose.\n- **1,600 mg/day total,** for example 400 mg PO four times daily.\n- **600 mg PO every 6 hours** (2,400 mg/day), which is a common anti-inflammatory dose.\n\nTell me the dose and frequency you want, and I'll enter it. If you do want 1600 mg four times daily, please confirm that. I'd suggest checking with pharmacy first."
